    "description": "Configure, preview, and generate realistic test data from the browser. A built-in, cross-platform engine runs eventgen.conf configurations directly, so SA-Eventgen is not required. Build stanzas with a guided editor, manage sample files, preview and test-send events, and monitor throughput.",
